<file path="README.md">
# Razorpay Vulcan Ledger

Autonomous AI Finance Controller built for the Razorpay AI Buildathon 2026 (Track 04).
Deterministic reconciliation engine (FastAPI + PostgreSQL) with a sandboxed LangGraph
agent for exception handling, and a Next.js operations dashboard.
# razorpay-vulcan-ledger
